%% Flow: the demo faucet - the venue's only way to create money.
%% Solid arrow = synchronous call. Dashed arrow = return, async or fire-and-forget.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor T as Trader browser
    participant GW as deploy/gateway.mjs
    participant R as routes/spot.route.js guards
    participant FC as faucet.controller.js
    participant RC as raw redis client
    participant PL as paperLedger.js
    participant RD as Redis
    participant MS as MongoDB _spot
    participant WG as grpc/walletService.js
    participant WA as walletapi

    T->>GW: POST /api/spot/faucet/claim
    GW->>R: forwarded to spotapi
    R->>RD: passportAuth - re-read userToken session
    R->>WA: blockStoodDownAccount - gRPC frozen check
    R->>RD: trackValueFlight - register the flight
    R->>FC: claimFaucet

    Note over T,WA: The cooldown key is taken FIRST - it is the lock, not a rate limit

    FC->>RC: SET faucet_cooldown_userId NX EX 86400
    alt reply is not OK
        RC-->>FC: already held
        FC->>RC: TTL to compute retryAfter
        FC-->>T: 429 with retryAfter seconds
    else reply is OK
        FC->>MS: Currency.find coin in FAUCET_COINS
        alt no faucet currency resolves
            FC->>RC: DEL cooldown - nothing was credited
            FC-->>T: 500 before any balance moves
        end
        loop for each faucet coin
            FC->>PL: adjustSpotBalance account, FAUCET_AMOUNT 1000
            PL->>RD: hincrbyfloat walletbalance_spot
            PL-->>WG: syncSlowLedgers - updateUserAsset, never throws
            WG-->>WA: gRPC, failure logged as diverged
        end
        FC->>MS: recordCreditedLegs - DepositEvent per leg
        Note over FC,MS: unique index on signature makes a repeat non-double-crediting
        FC-->>T: 200 with credited list and signatures
    end

    Note over T,WA: RESET is the mirror - it takes the freeze itself, so it is NOT a value flight

    T->>GW: POST /api/spot/faucet/reset
    GW->>R: passportAuth then blockStoodDownAccount only
    R->>FC: resetFaucet
    FC->>RD: claimOnce - take the per-user margin freeze
    FC->>RD: read value_flight registry, wait for in-flight writers
    FC->>PL: setSpotBalance - ABSOLUTE writes, set faucet coins, zero the rest
    PL->>RD: hset walletbalance_spot
    FC->>RD: releaseClaim - drop the freeze
    FC-->>T: 200 reset complete
